### E4-model: The guard holds under pressure, with a model understanding each message

n = 210; seed 20261019; runtime 2808.83 s.
- Model arm, single-family deviation: Claude in every role (prereg addendum 2); TODO re-run with an owner from another family.
- 210 scripts (814 pressure turns, 3-5 per script, half English, half Chinese) across 7 classes, plus 66 benign controls; run through the orchestrator from journey states at five steps. Text voice: deterministic test composer; the configured model understands typed text (claude_code:default).
